\section{Conclusion}

In this paper, we propose the SaE module, a upgraded version of SE module, to improve the  representational power with the increased cardinality. The proposed model attached to residual network is subjected to extensive experiments which achieves better performance than the existing models. In addition to the architecture, we also introduce the aggregated fully connected layers for its global representation learning capabilities. We hope the combination of spatial, channel-wise and global representations in between network architecture proves useful for having better representations. Finally, the proposed network may be helpful in learning important features better in vision based related fields.

